message: "If you use or discuss this non-commercial research prototype, cite it as an experimental RTL engineering artifact; it is not a production-qualified processor."
title: "RAQM Industrial — Versal AI Edge Gen 2 FPGA Datapath"
authors:
  - family-names: Sayın
    given-names: Oğuz Kağan
version: "4.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-22
license: "LicenseRef-RAQM-Research-Only-No-Commercial-Production-1.0"
abstract: >-
  A 128-lane, 256-bit synchronous FPGA vector datapath prototype with parallel
  B/C XOR transforms, selectable merge, optional feedback, AXI4-Stream data
  transport, and AXI4-Lite management control. Research and evaluation only;
  commercial use and commercial production are prohibited.
